5,1,1,talk,Minako,,"Hello everyone. Since our current arrangement is starting to break down, it's best we establish a clear, fair system. Let's start by looking at the data to see where the imbalances are.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I couldn't agree more, Minako. A bit of structured clarity might be just the remedy for our current... frictions. Let's see what the evidence suggests before we dive into the deep end of negotiations.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I agree. We need a practical foundation for this discussion. To ensure the system is equitable and sustainable, we must first analyze the actual usage patterns and the associated costs.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Efficiency is all well and good, but let's not pretend we're starting from a place of clarity. We've been operating on guesswork. I want to see the actual numbers before we decide what ""fair"" even looks like.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree. It's probably best to look at the facts first so we don't argue. I'll go along with whatever you all think is the right way to start.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minako,,"I'll look into ""Last year's tax, insurance and parking papers"" and ""Last year's fuel receipts."" I want to understand the baseline costs to determine what a truly even split would look like.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"I shall investigate ""What two other car-sharing households said"" and ""The spell of checking each other's figures."" I'm curious to see if others have discovered a magic formula for harmony, or if we're simply repeating history.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"I will examine the ""Hours of use recorded in the diary"" and the ""State of the car at handover."" I want to understand the actual daily reality of the vehicle's availability and its condition.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,"I'll take ""Last year's fuel receipts"" and ""Month's trial of recording every run."" If we're going to stop guessing, I need to see exactly how much is being spent and who is actually behind the wheel.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I'll... I'll check the ""Hours of use recorded in the diary"" and ""Trips that repeat weekly."" I just want to see how much time we're actually spending on the logistics of using the car.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minako,,"Since we have a good spread of research, I suggest we proceed. I'm interested to see if the fixed costs and fuel expenses align with our current contributions or if some of us are subsidizing others.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, a fascinating exercise in forensic accounting. I suspect we may find that our ""informal"" arrangement was less of a handshake and more of a gamble. I look forward to seeing whose luck has run out.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I believe the data will reveal a gap between the nominal schedule and the actual experience of using the car. I am particularly interested in whether the vehicle's condition is being maintained consistently.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Benjamin, your fascination with ""luck"" is amusing, but I'm more interested in the cold reality of the ledger. Let's see if the numbers actually support the stories we've been telling ourselves.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I hope the data helps us find a way that's easy for everyone. I don't want anyone to feel stressed or upset. I'll wait for the results with the rest of you.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minako,,"Let's all conduct our research carefully. Once we have the facts, we can discuss a system that is sustainable and fair for everyone. I will see you all in the next round.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"I shall embark on my research with the utmost diligence. I hope the wisdom of others can save us from our own clumsy attempts at cooperation. Until we reconvene to share our discoveries, farewell.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"I will focus on the objective data regarding usage and condition. When we return, I expect us to address the practical discrepancies in the car's availability and state. I will see you all in the next round.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shion,,"I'll be waiting. Let's see if the data actually reveals the truth, or if we're just rearranging the deck chairs on a sinking ship. I'm curious to see who's been hiding behind the guesswork.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
24,1,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'll... I'll do my best to look into the things I chose. I hope we can all find a solution that makes things simpler. See you all soon.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
